1. Nf3 c5 (1... Nf6 2. c4 { [%cal Gc7c6] } 2... c5 3. Nc3 Nc6 (3... g6 4. e4 d6 5. d4 cxd4 6. Nxd4 Bg7 7. Be2 O-O 8. O-O Nc6 9. Nc2 { We have transposed into the maroczy - we retreat with an early Nc2 to avoid theory. } { [%cal Bc8e6,Bc8d7,Gb2b3,Bc1e3,Bc1d2] }) (3... e6 4. g3 d5 5. cxd5 exd5 6. d4 Nc6 7. Bg2 Be7 8. dxc5 Bxc5 9. O-O) 4. d4 cxd4 5. Nxd4 g6 (5... e6 6. g3 Qb6 (6... Bc5 7. Nb3 Bb4 8. Bg2 O-O 9. O-O Bxc3 10. bxc3 d5 11. Nd4 Nxd4 12. Qxd4 dxc4 13. Qxc4 { [%cal Ga8b8,Gc1f4,Bd8e7,Ba2a4,Bc1a3] }) (6... Bb4 7. Bg2 Qa5 (7... O-O 8. O-O Bxc3 9. bxc3 a6 10. Ba3 Re8 11. Bd6 Qa5 12. Nb3 { Taking the pawn will trap the queen.
